                  <p class="blog-answer__label">Quick answer</p>
                  <p>Look for a sub-specialist cancer doctor, such as a surgical oncologist who focuses on your type of cancer, who sees patients by appointment, reviews your scans and reports with you, discusses complex cases in a multidisciplinary tumor board and welcomes questions and second opinions. Patient reviews that mention clear explanations and patience are a good sign. In Hyderabad, you can consult Dr. Anvesh Dharanikota at Arete Hospitals, Gachibowli, for an unhurried surgical oncology consultation.</p>
